<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram name="Continuous Access Evaluation (CAE)" id="d1"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1200" pageHeight="745" background="#FFFFFF" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="c2" value="&lt;b&gt;Continuous Access Evaluation (CAE)&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=22;fontColor=#323130;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="18.0" width="1120.0" height="30.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:13.5px;color:#605E5C&quot;&gt;Event-driven revocation – today implemented only by Microsoft resources&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;fontColor=#323130;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="50.0" width="1120.0" height="22.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=none;endFill=1;startArrow=none;startFill=1;strokeColor=#0078D4;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="40.0" y="82.0" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="1160.0" y="82.0" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="&lt;b&gt;Critical events&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• user disabled or deleted&lt;br&gt;• password changed or reset&lt;br&gt;• MFA enabled for the user&lt;br&gt;• admin revokes refresh tokens&lt;br&gt;• high user risk (ID Protection)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;+ IP-based location policies&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;fillColor=#FFF4CE;strokeColor=#986F0B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#323130;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="100.0" width="320.0" height="205.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="&lt;b&gt;Microsoft Entra ID&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.5px;color:#605E5C&quot;&gt;issues tokens · evaluates Conditional Access&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;fillColor=#DEECF9;strokeColor=#0078D4;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#323130;fontSize=14;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420.0" y="105.0" width="360.0" height="95.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;startArrow=none;startFill=1;strokeColor=#323130;strokeWidth=1.6;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="360.0" y="152.0" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="418.0" y="152.0" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="&lt;b&gt;CAE-enabled Microsoft resources&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Exchange Online · SharePoint Online&lt;br&gt;Teams · Microsoft Graph&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.5px;color:#605E5C&quot;&gt;subscribe to Entra ID critical events&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;fillColor=#DFF6DD;strokeColor=#107C10;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#323130;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="840.0" y="255.0" width="320.0" height="170.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;startArrow=none;startFill=1;strokeColor=#323130;strokeWidth=1.6;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="780.0" y="152.0" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="1000.0" y="253.0" as="targetPoint" /><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1000.0" y="152.0" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="2" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0078D4;strokeColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="794.0" y="140.0" width="24.0" height="24.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="critical event&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5px;color:#605E5C&quot;&gt;near real time (≤ ~15 min)&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontColor=#323130;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="820.0" y="104.0" width="175.0" height="42.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="&lt;b&gt;Client app (CAE-capable)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.5px;color:#605E5C&quot;&gt;declares client capability cp1 (MSAL)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;fillColor=#F3F2F1;strokeColor=#8A8886;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#323130;fontSize=14;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380.0" y="330.0" width="360.0" height="95.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;startArrow=none;startFill=1;strokeColor=#323130;strokeWidth=1.6;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="520.0" y="200.0" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="520.0" y="328.0" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="1" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0078D4;strokeColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="508.0" y="214.0" width="24.0" height="24.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="access token&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5px;color:#605E5C&quot;&gt;CAE: up to 28 h&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontColor=#323130;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="375.0" y="240.0" width="130.0" height="44.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;startArrow=none;startFill=1;strokeColor=#323130;strokeWidth=1.6;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="640.0" y="330.0" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="640.0" y="202.0" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="5" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0078D4;strokeColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="628.0" y="292.0" width="24.0" height="24.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="claims request&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5px;color:#605E5C&quot;&gt;re-evaluation:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.5px;color:#605E5C&quot;&gt;sign in again or blocked&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontColor=#323130;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="655.0" y="222.0" width="170.0" height="62.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;startArrow=none;startFill=1;strokeColor=#323130;strokeWidth=1.6;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="740.0" y="352.0" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="838.0" y="352.0" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c20" value="3" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0078D4;strokeColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="748.0" y="340.0" width="24.0" height="24.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c21" value="call" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontColor=#323130;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="772.0" y="322.0" width="66.0" height="24.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c22" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;startArrow=none;startFill=1;strokeColor=#323130;strokeWidth=1.6;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="840.0" y="400.0" as="sourcePoint" /><mxPoint x="742.0" y="400.0" as="targetPoint" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c23" value="4" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0078D4;strokeColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="808.0" y="388.0" width="24.0" height="24.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c24" value="401 + claims" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontColor=#323130;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="745.0" y="405.0" width="95.0" height="24.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c25" value="&lt;b&gt;Your own API: not a CAE resource today&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• there is no documented way for a custom or&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; third-party API to receive Entra ID's critical events&lt;br&gt;• it validates tokens offline and accepts them&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; until they expire&lt;br&gt;• CAE builds on the OpenID CAEP standard, but the&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; event feed is consumed only by Microsoft services&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;→ mitigate with short lifetimes and step-up&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;fillColor=#FDE7E9;strokeColor=#D13438;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#323130;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40.0" y="475.0" width="545.0" height="245.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c26" value="&lt;b&gt;What a custom app CAN do: be a CAE-capable client&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• declare the cp1 client capability in MSAL&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.5px&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; .WithClientCapabilities(new[] { &quot;cp1&quot; })&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;• on 401 with error=&quot;insufficient_claims&quot;, pass the&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; claims challenge back to AcquireTokenSilent /&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; AcquireTokenInteractive&lt;br&gt;• works when calling Microsoft Graph and the other&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; CAE-enabled Microsoft APIs&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.5px;color:#605E5C&quot;&gt;Learn: How to use CAE enabled APIs in your applications&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;fillColor=#DFF6DD;strokeColor=#107C10;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#323130;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="605.0" y="475.0" width="555.0" height="245.0" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>